{"id":"8ee39070d2fffa3c","group":"58","path":"58/batch12/58-df-zfc-prob-expectation-functional.md","title":"ZFC Prob Expectation Functional","display":"df-zfc-prob-expectation-functional — ZFC Prob Expectation Functional","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-prob-expectation-functional","aliases":["58-df-zfc-prob-expectation-functional"],"display":"df-zfc-prob-expectation-functional — ZFC Prob Expectation Functional","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch19/58-df-zfc-prob-probability-space.md]]","[[../batch01/58-df-integrability]]","[[../batch02/58-df-integral]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-prob-expectation-functional"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-prob-expectation-functional</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-prob-expectation-functional — ZFC Prob Expectation Functional"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d4d304b0bbb11c1a\" href=\"?note=d4d304b0bbb11c1a\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-zfc-prob-probability-space.md\">../batch19/58-df-zfc-prob-probability-space.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"7df291a6731ae8a3\" href=\"?note=7df291a6731ae8a3\" title=\"../batch01/58-df-integrability\">../batch01/58-df-integrability</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"4884f45058a56aac\" href=\"?note=4884f45058a56aac\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-integral\">../batch02/58-df-integral</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\">\\((\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\\)</span> (probability space, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"d4d304b0bbb11c1a\" href=\"?note=d4d304b0bbb11c1a\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-zfc-prob-probability-space.md\">../batch19/58-df-zfc-prob-probability-space.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb E\">\\(\\mathbb E\\)</span> (expectation functional)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal I_1(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\">\\(\\mathcal I_1(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\\)</span> (set of integrable real random variables, defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcProbProbabilitySpace}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcProbProbabilitySpace}_S\\)</span> (probability-space predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"d4d304b0bbb11c1a\" href=\"?note=d4d304b0bbb11c1a\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-zfc-prob-probability-space.md\">../batch19/58-df-zfc-prob-probability-space.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PIntegrable}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{PIntegrable}_S\\)</span> (integrability predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"7df291a6731ae8a3\" href=\"?note=7df291a6731ae8a3\" title=\"../batch01/58-df-integrability\">../batch01/58-df-integrability</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcProbExpectationFunctional}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcProbExpectationFunctional}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}prob\\text{-}integrable\\text{-}domain} \\vdash \\mathcal I_1(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\\coloneqq\\{f\\in\\mathbb R^\\Omega:\\mathrm{PIntegrable}_S(f,1,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}prob\\text{-}integrable\\text{-}domain} \\vdash \\mathcal I_1(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\\coloneqq\\{f\\in\\mathbb R^\\Omega:\\mathrm{PIntegrable}_S(f,1,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}prob\\text{-}expectation\\text{-}functional} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcProbExpectationFunctional}_S(\\mathbb E,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcProbProbabilitySpace}_S(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\\land\\mathbb E\\in\\mathbb R^{\\mathcal I_1(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)}\\land\\forall f\\in\\mathcal I_1(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\\;\\left(\\mathbb E(f)=\\int_\\Omega\\max(f,0)\\,d\\mathbb P-\\int_\\Omega\\max(-f,0)\\,d\\mathbb P\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}prob\\text{-}expectation\\text{-}functional} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcProbExpectationFunctional}_S(\\mathbb E,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcProbProbabilitySpace}_S(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\\land\\mathbb E\\in\\mathbb R^{\\mathcal I_1(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)}\\land\\forall f\\in\\mathcal I_1(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\\;\\left(\\mathbb E(f)=\\int_\\Omega\\max(f,0)\\,d\\mathbb P-\\int_\\Omega\\max(-f,0)\\,d\\mathbb P\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>A functional is determined on its whole domain, not by one evaluation at an externally supplied random variable.</li>\n<li>The upstream integral atom formalizes nonnegative Lebesgue integration, so the signed integral is expressed through the positive and negative parts.  The domain is the set of integrable functions, not the almost-everywhere quotient <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L^1\">\\(L^1\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch19/58-df-zfc-prob-probability-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"d4d304b0bbb11c1a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-df-zfc-prob-probability-space.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch01/58-df-integrability","status":"resolved","id":"7df291a6731ae8a3","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch01/58-df-integrability]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-integral","status":"resolved","id":"4884f45058a56aac","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-integral]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch19/58-df-zfc-prob-probability-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"d4d304b0bbb11c1a","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)$ (probability space, see [[../batch19/58-df-zfc-prob-probability-space.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch19/58-df-zfc-prob-probability-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"d4d304b0bbb11c1a","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcProbProbabilitySpace}_S$ (probability-space predicate, see [[../batch19/58-df-zfc-prob-probability-space.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch01/58-df-integrability","status":"resolved","id":"7df291a6731ae8a3","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{PIntegrable}_S$ (integrability predicate, see [[../batch01/58-df-integrability]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb E","displ